<div class="col-md-6">
<p class="h3 text-white mb-4">Our Mission</p>

<p><em>Central Alabama Community College promotes student success through affordable, comprehensive, and a wide range of academic and career programs. The college strives to improve the quality of life for its community by supporting economic growth, community development, and workforce advancement.&nbsp;</em></p>

<p><em><a href="/about/mission-statement">Vision Statement &amp; Core Values</a>&nbsp;</em></p>

